### Step 1: Codebase Architecture Exploration & Candidates Proposing
The codebase was analyzed under the lens of the codebase-architecture guidelines, focusing on **locality**, **leverage**, and establishing clean **seams**. Exactly **6 architecture improvement candidates** were identified and written to a detailed Markdown report with before/after visualisations (saved to `/root/.gemini/tmp/gitic/architecture-review-20260726.md`).

